descriptions.text_6041fdd3_151:
Compression level for the generated image, where 100 is the least
compressed. Only applies when `output_format` is `jpeg` or `webp`;
ignored for `png`.

descriptions.text_c00e4ce9_208:
Pixels to expand on the left. Omit the field to use the default of `512`;
send `0` to leave this edge unexpanded. The requested size is not always
the size you get back — see the description of this endpoint.
